    {
      "title": "Core concept 5 — The cold open",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Three patterns that work:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/audio-script-writing/#core-concept-5-the-cold-open",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Pattern A - Drop into a scene:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/audio-script-writing/#core-concept-5-the-cold-open",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "> It's 2 a.m. The paging system goes off. Marcus rolls over, reads the alert, and the alert is wrong.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/audio-script-writing/#core-concept-5-the-cold-open",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Pattern B - A question with stakes:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/audio-script-writing/#core-concept-5-the-cold-open",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "> What would you do if your entire backup tier disappeared in the middle of a restore?",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/audio-script-writing/#core-concept-5-the-cold-open",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Pattern C - A single startling fact:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/audio-script-writing/#core-concept-5-the-cold-open",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "> Last year, 47% of incident retrospectives never produced a single action item.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/audio-script-writing/#core-concept-5-the-cold-open",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Anti-pattern - The throat-clear:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/audio-script-writing/#core-concept-5-the-cold-open",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "> Hi everyone, welcome to the podcast. Today we're going to be talking about...",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/audio-script-writing/#core-concept-5-the-cold-open",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Core concept 7 — Voice-UI prompts (Alexa, Google Assistant, Siri)",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Three constraints beyond \"writing for the ear\":",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/audio-script-writing/#core-concept-7-voice-ui-prompts-alexa-google-assistant-siri",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "The prompt must end with an explicit prompt-for-input.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/audio-script-writing/#core-concept-7-voice-ui-prompts-alexa-google-assistant-siri",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Confirm without echoing. \"Adding milk to your list\" is good; \"I heard you say milk; I will now add milk to your list\" is voice-UI throat-clearing.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/audio-script-writing/#core-concept-7-voice-ui-prompts-alexa-google-assistant-siri",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Three-option ceiling. Lists of more than three options exceed working memory.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/audio-script-writing/#core-concept-7-voice-ui-prompts-alexa-google-assistant-siri",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Core concept 8 — IVR scripts",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Most-likely path first. Order by call-volume share, not alphabetical.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/audio-script-writing/#core-concept-8-ivr-scripts",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Always offer a human escape. \"Press 0 at any time to reach an agent.\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/audio-script-writing/#core-concept-8-ivr-scripts",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Confirm critical inputs. Read back at the cadence a person can write down.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/audio-script-writing/#core-concept-8-ivr-scripts",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Re-prompt twice, then escalate. Caller silence twice in a row = route to agent.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/audio-script-writing/#core-concept-8-ivr-scripts",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Core concept 10 — Podcast show notes craft",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Required sections:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/audio-script-writing/#core-concept-10-podcast-show-notes-craft",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Episode title - keep under 60 characters; concrete, specific",
